{"request":{"method":"GET","url":"https://api.mangaupdates.com/v1/series/26643241978","body":""},"status":200,"headers":{"Content-Type":"application/json"},"json":{"series_id":26643241978,"title":"Tongari Boushi no Atelier","url":"https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/c8mp52y/tongari-boushi-no-atelier","associated":[{"title":"Asrama Topi Lancip"},{"title":"Atelier of Witch Hat (Indonesian)"},{"title":"Atelier of Witch Hat: Das Geheimnis der Hexen"},{"title":"Atelier spiczastych kapeluszy"},{"title":"Ateliér špičatých klobouků"},{"title":"Boszorkánysüveg–műhely"},{"title":"Cadı Şapkası Atölyesi"},{"title":"El Atelier del Sombrero Puntiagudo"},{"title":"L'atelier des sorciers"},{"title":"Pondok Penyihir Topi Lancip"},{"title":"Tongari Booshi no Atorie"},{"title":"Tongari Boushi no Atelier ~ Atelier of Witch Hat"},{"title":"Tongari Boushi no Atorie"},{"title":"Tongari Bōshi no Atelier"},{"title":"Tongari Bōshi no Atorie"},{"title":"Tongariboushi no Atelier"},{"title":"Witch Hat Atelier"},{"title":"Xưởng Phép Thuật"},{"title":"Δ帽子"},{"title":"Ателие за островърхи шапки"},{"title":"Ателье колдовских колпаков"},{"title":"Ательє чаклунських капелюхів"},{"title":"ورشة قبعة الساحرة"},{"title":"बोक्सी टोपीको एटलिएर"},{"title":"จอมเวทฝึกหัดกับหมวกมหัศจรรย์"},{"title":"とんがり帽子のアトリエ"},{"title":"とんがり帽子のアトリエ ~ Atelier of Witch Hat"},{"title":"尖帽子的魔法工坊"},{"title":"尖帽子的魔法工房"},{"title":"고깔모자의 아틀리에"}],"description":"From Kodansha:  \nIn a world where everyone takes wonders like magic spells and dragons for granted, Coco is a girl with a simple dream: She wants to be a witch. But everybody knows magicians are born, not made, and Coco was not born with a gift for magic. Resigned to her un-magical life, Coco is about to give up on her dream to become a witch until the day she meets Qifrey, a mysterious, traveling magician. After secretly seeing Qifrey perform magic in a way she’s never seen before, Coco soon learns what everybody “knows” might not be the truth, and discovers that her magical dream may not be as far away as it may seem.\n\n**Original Manga:** [Comic Days](https://comic-days.com/episode/13932016480031217072), [Morning](https://morning.kodansha.co.jp/c/tongariboushi/), [Pocket Magazine](https://pocket.shonenmagazine.com/title/01683/episode/343238) \n\n**Official English Release:** [Comic DAYS](https://comic-days.com/episode/3270375685330852748),  [Coolmic](https://coolmic.me/titles/5873), [K Manga](https://kmanga.kodansha.com/title/10065/episode/313463), [Kodansha](https://kodansha.us/series/witch-hat-atelier/), [Mangaplaza](https://mangaplaza.com/title/0303007358/), [Manta](https://manta.net/en/series/witch-hat-atelier?seriesId=5251), [OMOI](https://www.omoi.com/series/witch-hat-atelier), [Renta!](https://www.ebookrenta.com/renta/sc/frm/item/147712)\n\n##### Notes: Won Best Seinen at 24th Manga Barcelona Awards in 2018. Nominated Best Youth Comic at Angoulême International Comics Festival in 2019. Won Next Manga at Ridibooks Comic Award, won Daruma d'or Manga at Japan Expo Awards, won Best Seinen Manga at Mangawa Prize and won Grand Prize at Les Mordus du Manga Award in 2019. Won Best U.S. Edition of International Material - Asia, together with [Cats of the Louvre](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series.html?id=21543597287) at the Eisner Awards in 2020 and won Best Manga at the Harvey Awards in 2020. Won Best Seinen at 28th Manga Barcelona Awards in 2022, at 29th Manga Barcelona Awards in 2023. Nominated for the 11th Manga Taishou Award in 2018 and the Harvey Award for Best Manga in 2024. Nominated Best Manga at Harvey Awards in 2024. Won Best Manga at Harvey Awards in 2025. Won Daruma for Finest Craftsmanship at Japan Expo Awards in 2026. Translated in [Bulgarian](https://probook-bg.com/magazin/atelie-za-ostrovurhi-shapki-tom-1/), in [Chinese](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc26727), in [Czech](https://www.obchod.crew.cz/kategorie-95088/komiks/atelier-spicatych-klobouku), in French ([PIKA](https://www.pika.fr/livres-series-latelier-des-sorciers/), [PIKA édition grimoire](https://www.pika.fr/livres-series-latelier-des-sorciers-edition-grimoire/)), in [German](https://www.egmont-shop.de/manga/atelier-of-witch-hat/), in [Hungarian](https://gabo.hu/kepregenyek/3753-sirahama-kamome-boszorkanysuveg-muhely-1-9789635669233.html), in [Indonesian](https://www.elexmedia.id/products/EMK-RC000041106/atelier-of-witch-hat-01), in Korean ([Kakao Page](https://page.kakao.com/content/52727180/), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/atelier), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/haksan_c2_00067), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=4073612), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/505019607)), etc.\n\n\n","image":{"url":{"original":"https://cdn.mangaupdates.com/image/i531813.jpg","thumb":"https://cdn.mangaupdates.com/image/thumb/i531813.jpg"},"height":400,"width":281},"type":"Manga","year":"2016","bayesian_rating":8.25,"rating_votes":392,"genres":[{"genre":"Adventure"},{"genre":"Comedy"},{"genre":"Drama"},{"genre":"Fantasy"},{"genre":"School Life"},{"genre":"Seinen"},{"genre":"Slice of Life"}],"categories":[{"series_id":26643241978,"category":"Abuse of Power","votes":2,"votes_plus":2,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":54014590785},{"series_id":26643241978,"category":"Abusive Authority Figure/s","votes":1,"votes_plus":1,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":54014590785},{"series_id":26643241978,"category":"Abusive Parent/s","votes":1,"votes_plus":1,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":54014590785},{"series_id":26643241978,"category":"Accident/s","votes":7,"votes_plus":8,"votes_minus":1,"added_by":2095673730},{"series_id":26643241978,"category":"Adapted to Anime","votes":7,"votes_plus":7,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":59641381499},{"series_id":26643241978,"category":"Adult Female Character/s","votes":1,"votes_plus":1,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":54014590785},{"series_id":26643241978,"category":"Adult Male Character/s","votes":1,"votes_plus":1,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":54014590785},{"series_id":26643241978,"category":